// Hot batch 272: sixty-one- and sixty-two-instruction functions no route reaches, written by hand from `tools.disasm`
// and verified by synthetic cases (a string-suffix compare, a free-list split, insertion sorts on two keys, element
// copies with nested vectors, an unaligned block copy, a bit-mask dispatch and handle-guarded calls).
// No names: none has evidence.
